----------------------------------------------------------------------
How this was made
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The author designed and directed the project and reviewed and accepted
the code, documents and results. Language models (Anthropic Claude
models, run through Claude Code; exact versions were not recorded)
drafted most of the code and documentation, did the imagery ratings, and
diagnosed the routes and bridges. Every agreement statistic (kappa)
quoted in this repository is agreement between model instances. No
person rated imagery, and nothing was checked on the ground. Scripts
checked the build: python-osw-validation checked form,
validators/post_build_checks.py checked elevation, connectivity, ramps
and widths, and the test suite checked the pipeline functions. axe-core
and pa11y checked the demo page. Language models did not generate or
modify the source data. The protocols and ratings are in evaluation/.
